   * cross-game homepages), but the per-family pages keep mod detail links
   * under the shared `/mods/[family]/[slug]` (or portal equivalent) route
   * while this page itself lives at `/mods/games/[family]` — hence the split.
   */
  browsePath?: string;
  /** Current `?q=`. */
